  "summary": "On the back with legs together to the ceiling, the legs draw a circle — to one side, down, round and up — as the pelvis tips with them.",
  "steps": [
    "Lie on the back, arms pressing down by the sides, legs together to the ceiling.",
    "Breathe in to take the legs to one side, down and round.",
    "Breathe out to bring them up the other side to centre.",
    "Reverse."
